        "path": "std/os/unix.iv",
        "content": "-- Declares Unix platform operations.\n--- Unix pipes, signals, and memory mapping handles. ---\npublic define Pipe as opaque.\npublic define Map as opaque.\npublic function pipe() {\n  constant result of type pointer to Pipe is uninitialized.\n  give result.\n}\npublic function signal(number integer 32) {\n  give nothing.\n}\npublic function mmap(size integer) {\n  constant result of type pointer to Map is uninitialized.\n  give result.\n}\npublic function munmap(mapping pointer to Map) {\n  give nothing.\n}\n"
